WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:09.670
Explosive Shoot

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:19.810
Keep fighting chasing your dream

00:00:19.810 --> 00:00:23.140
with love, courage and friendship

00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:26.640
This Blade and I are one

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:29.680
Spin as hard as you can until the limit

00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:32.780
BURNING SOUL

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:46.200
The things I can't do alone

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:50.140
are not impossible if you're with me

00:00:50.490 --> 00:00:52.960
Come with me

00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:56.280
to the ends of this world

00:00:58.070 --> 00:01:03.540
The Four Sacred Beasts are athletes of love

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:07.100
Shine! Open your eyes!

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:09.730
Dragoon  Dranzer  Draciel  Driger

00:01:09.730 --> 00:01:12.450
Awaken!

00:01:12.790 --> 00:01:16.060
Fly across the sky, my energy

00:01:16.060 --> 00:01:19.380
Rise up, Sacred Beast!

00:01:19.380 --> 00:01:22.830
To defeat all the enemies who stand in our way

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:26.050
jump, bearing everyone's hopes

00:01:26.070 --> 00:01:29.080
SHINING SOUL

00:01:36.670 --> 00:01:39.280
The second day of the tournament is here...

00:01:39.280 --> 00:01:41.640
Takao, it's morning.

00:01:41.640 --> 00:01:42.530
Takao..?

00:01:46.120 --> 00:01:47.960
Alright, how about this?

00:01:48.460 --> 00:01:51.750
Still no good, your balance is off! One more!

00:01:51.750 --> 00:01:52.840
Takao.

00:01:53.290 --> 00:01:54.420
Professor.

00:01:54.660 --> 00:01:59.430
This is quite a surprise. For <i>you</i> to wake up before me.

00:01:59.430 --> 00:02:01.680
As if I could sleep at a time like this!

00:02:01.970 --> 00:02:07.180
I want to get used to the new Dragoon you made for me as soon as I can.

00:02:12.400 --> 00:02:17.410
American Hero
Micheal's Power

00:02:27.040 --> 00:02:28.790
This sense of pressure...

00:02:28.790 --> 00:02:31.260
Ahh... I can't get enough!

00:02:31.260 --> 00:02:33.430
Takao, get off already.

00:02:33.790 --> 00:02:35.060
What was that for?!

00:02:41.810 --> 00:02:43.270
Okay, take them in.

00:02:43.640 --> 00:02:44.840
Mama!

00:02:44.840 --> 00:02:45.770
Max.

00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:47.050
Good morning.

00:02:47.650 --> 00:02:51.650
What's going on here?
Are you moving in here or something?

00:02:52.580 --> 00:02:55.190
This is the PPB's standard equipment.

00:02:55.190 --> 00:02:58.630
Mechanic, analyzing, operation, medical.

00:02:58.890 --> 00:03:03.870
Staff members from different departments are here to support us in our fights.

00:03:03.870 --> 00:03:06.540
These guys sure love showing off their wealth.

00:03:06.540 --> 00:03:08.720
It's kind of overwhelming.

00:03:09.500 --> 00:03:15.010
What's so good about this? Just you wait, I'm so gonna beat you at the finals!

00:03:15.160 --> 00:03:22.480
At the finals? That's weird... According to our schedule, you will lose today's match.

00:03:23.280 --> 00:03:25.410
Don't schedule things on your own!

00:03:25.410 --> 00:03:30.520
You're going against the Republic of Ecuador, right? The result is evident.

00:03:31.600 --> 00:03:35.030
Is Ecuador that strong of a team?

00:03:35.560 --> 00:03:40.120
Let's just say it's the one team that we're happy not having to fight against.

00:03:40.120 --> 00:03:41.040
Emily.

00:03:41.350 --> 00:03:42.340
Let's go.

00:03:42.340 --> 00:03:43.540
Yes, Director.

00:03:43.540 --> 00:03:47.140
Well, do your best. Bye.

00:03:47.290 --> 00:03:49.630
Gah! She pisses me off to no end!

00:03:49.630 --> 00:03:52.000
Hey! Wait, you! Come back here!

00:03:52.000 --> 00:03:52.950
Mama...

00:03:52.950 --> 00:03:54.720
<i>Good morning!</i>

00:03:54.720 --> 00:03:59.800
The second day of the World Tournament! Even more exciting battles await us!

00:04:01.980 --> 00:04:07.040
Fighting the second match will be the BBA team and the Ecuadorian team!

00:04:07.040 --> 00:04:10.560
Whoever wins this battle will advance to the semi-finals!

00:04:10.960 --> 00:04:14.700
Do your best, Takao! Don't lose your focus!

00:04:14.700 --> 00:04:17.010
<i>Oh, samurai! Great!</i>

00:04:17.320 --> 00:04:20.320
<i>Yes, I am a samurai.</i>

00:04:21.730 --> 00:04:22.410
Hm?

00:04:22.610 --> 00:04:25.690
Oh, now this is one unorthodox team.

00:04:28.710 --> 00:04:33.910
What's with them? They don't look strong like Emily told us...

00:04:33.910 --> 00:04:37.680
Say, Professor. What do we know
about the Ecuadorian team?

00:04:37.680 --> 00:04:40.250
About that... We have no
info about them, so nothing.

00:04:40.250 --> 00:04:44.460
Whatever the opponent, we just need to do what we always do and win.

00:04:44.460 --> 00:04:45.410
That's all.

00:04:45.560 --> 00:04:46.970
That's all, you say...

00:04:46.970 --> 00:04:50.830
He put it badly, but Kai is essentially right.

00:04:50.830 --> 00:04:53.930
We just need to be faithful to our own fighting style.

00:04:54.440 --> 00:04:57.610
Well, let's move on to the introduction of the stadium.

00:04:57.610 --> 00:05:02.150
Here is the stadium that will make today's battles even more thrilling!

00:05:05.630 --> 00:05:09.080
It's the Hawaii stadium, based on America's greatest resort spot!

00:05:09.080 --> 00:05:16.600
If you fall into the sea, of course your Bey will stop. It's a tricky stadium that will put to test your technique and jugement.

00:05:16.830 --> 00:05:19.460
Sounds fun! I'm getting fired up!

00:05:19.720 --> 00:05:22.460
Okay then, let's begin with the first set.

00:05:22.850 --> 00:05:24.960
For the BBA team, Rei!

00:05:25.300 --> 00:05:28.220
And for the Ecuadorian team, Santiago!

00:05:28.480 --> 00:05:30.700
Contestants, get to the shoot points.

00:05:31.410 --> 00:05:33.070
Don't let your guard down, Rei!

00:05:33.070 --> 00:05:34.230
Fight!

00:05:35.180 --> 00:05:37.390
Your Bey sure looks cool!

00:05:37.390 --> 00:05:37.990
What?

00:05:38.440 --> 00:05:41.470
But look here, my Bey looks cool too, doesn't it?

00:05:41.960 --> 00:05:43.310
What's with this guy?

00:05:43.690 --> 00:05:45.200
First battle. Ready?

00:05:45.200 --> 00:05:47.840
Three, Two, One!

00:05:47.840 --> 00:05:49.280
Go... Shoot!

00:05:56.310 --> 00:05:58.630
Look at it spinning, so awesome!

00:05:59.010 --> 00:06:02.420
What's this guy's plan? Is he trying to get me to lower my guard?

00:06:03.110 --> 00:06:04.840
If you're not going to me, I will!

00:06:04.840 --> 00:06:05.680
Driger!

00:06:11.420 --> 00:06:14.850
Oh, Rei is the one to strike first!

00:06:14.850 --> 00:06:17.810
Santiago was easily blown away!

00:06:18.000 --> 00:06:19.000
Huh?

00:06:19.260 --> 00:06:21.020
Well, that was weak.

00:06:21.020 --> 00:06:22.100
It's not over.

00:06:22.100 --> 00:06:23.480
Come out!

00:06:26.090 --> 00:06:26.830
What?!

00:06:26.830 --> 00:06:30.410
Now! Iguana Attack!

00:06:32.250 --> 00:06:32.880
No way!

00:06:39.290 --> 00:06:42.920
Driger is down! The winner is Santiago!

00:06:42.920 --> 00:06:46.660
Yay, I did it! i did it!
Wow! That surprise attack caught everyone off guard!

00:06:47.040 --> 00:06:49.930
Rei, I told you to stay focused!

00:06:50.290 --> 00:06:51.420
I don't know...

00:06:51.420 --> 00:06:52.180
Rei?

00:06:52.520 --> 00:06:55.050
I didn't lose my cool,

00:06:55.050 --> 00:06:55.900
but...

00:06:56.250 --> 00:06:57.700
I couldn't grasp it.

00:06:57.700 --> 00:07:01.200
He's different from every opponent I've fought against till now.

00:07:01.360 --> 00:07:02.870
What do you mean?

00:07:02.870 --> 00:07:06.890
I couldn't feel any fighting spirit or killing intent coming from him.

00:07:06.890 --> 00:07:10.630
I have no idea what is going though his head.

00:07:10.630 --> 00:07:13.280
Iguana Attack...

00:07:13.280 --> 00:07:15.200
I see... I got it!

00:07:15.460 --> 00:07:21.920
Now I know where they come from! They're from the Galapagos Archipelago!

00:07:22.200 --> 00:07:24.230
Galapagos Archipelago..?

00:07:24.720 --> 00:07:31.120
It's a mysterious group of islands, where many rare animals live in its peculiar environment.

00:07:31.120 --> 00:07:35.280
They've been living carefree in this peculiar environment.

00:07:35.280 --> 00:07:42.280
In other words, just like the animals living independently in the Galapagos islands, they're aligned with nature!

00:07:42.530 --> 00:07:44.080
Aligned with nature?

00:07:44.080 --> 00:07:46.780
What do you think about my Iguana Attack?

00:07:46.960 --> 00:07:48.040
You...

00:07:48.040 --> 00:07:52.490
That move was taught to me by my iguana friend.

00:07:52.490 --> 00:07:55.360
He's the one who gave me this Bey, too!

00:07:57.680 --> 00:08:01.760
I always loved playing hide and
seek on my island's rocky area.

00:08:04.200 --> 00:08:06.160
Found you, Iguana!

00:08:11.120 --> 00:08:12.280
Uh..?

00:08:12.820 --> 00:08:17.920
But I really wanted a Bey.
They're famous all around the world.

00:08:17.920 --> 00:08:20.010
I want a Bey...

00:08:20.640 --> 00:08:24.400
No, I don't mean I got tired of playing with you!

00:08:28.190 --> 00:08:29.960
Iguana!

00:08:31.300 --> 00:08:35.320
Day after day, I waited for Iguana's return.

00:08:35.760 --> 00:08:38.070
I must have hurt Iguana's feelings...

00:08:38.960 --> 00:08:40.960
Iguana!

00:08:42.710 --> 00:08:45.660
This is a Bey! I see!

00:08:45.660 --> 00:08:48.360
You went to look for a Bey, all for me!

00:08:51.800 --> 00:08:54.000
It's a nice story, isn't it?

00:08:54.500 --> 00:08:55.810
See you.

00:08:56.440 --> 00:08:59.060
It's bull. It has to be.

00:08:59.060 --> 00:09:02.170
That elusiveness is their strength.

00:09:02.620 --> 00:09:05.160
And it's not like they're doing it on purpose.

00:09:05.160 --> 00:09:11.740
Now I see why the American team is afraid of facing them. It's impossible to gather any data from them!

00:09:12.390 --> 00:09:16.500
They're polar opposites of the American team!

00:09:16.500 --> 00:09:20.460
Will the Ecuador team keep winning?

00:09:20.460 --> 00:09:23.590
Or will the BBA team show its pride?

00:09:23.590 --> 00:09:28.200
The second battle will be that of Max against Fernando!

00:09:28.200 --> 00:09:31.240
We're in your hands, Max. Don't you dare lose!

00:09:31.240 --> 00:09:32.480
Leave it to me.

00:09:32.680 --> 00:09:36.820
Anyway, be careful not to get swept up in your opponent's pace.

00:09:36.820 --> 00:09:37.970
That's not all.

00:09:38.310 --> 00:09:41.720
This stadium is similar to their home turf.

00:09:41.920 --> 00:09:43.180
Don't forget that.

00:09:43.180 --> 00:09:44.550
Thank you, Kai.

00:09:44.800 --> 00:09:46.860
Second battle, ready?

00:09:47.080 --> 00:09:49.780
Three, Two, One!

00:09:49.780 --> 00:09:51.760
Go... Shoot!

00:09:59.310 --> 00:10:05.000
That kind of attack doesn't even bother me! My Draciel is the strongest defender.

00:10:05.280 --> 00:10:07.580
Wow, that's so cool!

00:10:07.580 --> 00:10:09.840
Then how about this?

00:10:10.050 --> 00:10:12.520
Sea Lion Attack!

00:10:18.860 --> 00:10:19.880
<i>What?!</i>

00:10:19.880 --> 00:10:25.010
Oh! Fernando's Bey is tossing Draciel in the air!

00:10:28.290 --> 00:10:32.310
It's just like a sea lion playing with a ball!

00:10:32.780 --> 00:10:37.280
That's right. After all, this move was taught to me by my sea lion friend.

00:10:37.620 --> 00:10:39.880
One day, when I was practicing with my Bey...

00:10:39.880 --> 00:10:40.900
Oh no...

00:10:40.900 --> 00:10:42.390
My precious Bey...

00:10:47.760 --> 00:10:49.360
I know!

00:10:49.800 --> 00:10:53.100
And that's when I came up with this move.

00:10:53.100 --> 00:10:54.250
A-A sea lion..?

00:10:55.480 --> 00:10:59.750
Look at that, Takao.
Draciel's rotation is slowing down.

00:11:00.570 --> 00:11:08.560
By tossing Draciel up like that, it's using his own Bey as a cushion and absorbing Draciel's rotation.

00:11:08.940 --> 00:11:14.370
Even a defense-type like Draciel can't do anything against an attack that comes from below.

00:11:14.370 --> 00:11:15.320
This is bad...

00:11:15.320 --> 00:11:17.840
What do I do? At this rate..!

00:11:19.940 --> 00:11:24.350
What? Fernando's Bey suddenly left the stadium!

00:11:24.350 --> 00:11:25.440
Huh?

00:11:25.830 --> 00:11:29.260
This battle ends with Max's victory!

00:11:29.640 --> 00:11:32.910
Ahah, you really are like a sea lion.

00:11:32.910 --> 00:11:34.290
What now?!

00:11:34.290 --> 00:11:36.080
Well, you see...

00:11:40.120 --> 00:11:42.640
Uh? You don't want to play anymore?

00:11:42.640 --> 00:11:44.850
Hey! Where are you going?

00:11:44.850 --> 00:11:46.850
Come back! Hey!

00:11:47.040 --> 00:11:49.550
Sea lions are really fickle.

00:11:49.550 --> 00:11:51.980
I don't feel like I won this match...

00:11:52.770 --> 00:11:54.680
What should we do?

00:11:54.680 --> 00:11:55.840
Yeah...

00:12:06.090 --> 00:12:10.570
The third battle will be where everything is settled!

00:12:10.570 --> 00:12:12.280
The last ones to fight will be...

00:12:12.800 --> 00:12:14.300
Takao Kinomiya and...

00:12:14.600 --> 00:12:16.340
Bartolomeo!

00:12:16.340 --> 00:12:17.790
We're in your hands, Takao.

00:12:17.790 --> 00:12:18.680
Yeah!

00:12:18.680 --> 00:12:22.930
Wait, Takao. Until now, the flow has been with the Ecuadorian team.

00:12:22.930 --> 00:12:26.040
Please be extra careful not
to get swept up in their pace.

00:12:26.040 --> 00:12:27.550
I know, I know!

00:12:27.780 --> 00:12:31.560
Takao, show them the result of your training!

00:12:31.560 --> 00:12:33.760
Go! Go! Takao!

00:12:34.420 --> 00:12:35.720
What's with that Bey?

00:12:35.720 --> 00:12:37.450
What, this?

00:12:37.870 --> 00:12:40.990
This was a gift from my giant tortoise friend.

00:12:41.310 --> 00:12:42.490
Giant tortoise?

00:12:42.760 --> 00:12:46.300
One day, some island bullies
were harassing a giant tortoise.

00:12:46.300 --> 00:12:47.580
So I went and...

00:12:49.630 --> 00:12:51.560
Hey, stop that!

00:12:54.120 --> 00:12:57.240
You want to give me something as a way to thank me?

00:12:57.240 --> 00:13:02.210
You don't need to. Anyway, the thing I want is hard to come by.

00:13:02.410 --> 00:13:06.970
What I want is a Beyblade.
They are rare around these parts.

00:13:16.880 --> 00:13:19.160
This is... a Bey!

00:13:19.530 --> 00:13:23.040
Stop lying! As if I could believe such bull!

00:13:23.040 --> 00:13:25.900
Takao! Don't listen to them!

00:13:25.900 --> 00:13:28.400
- After that, the tortoise...
- I can't hear you!

00:13:28.400 --> 00:13:31.000
He's been swept up right from the start.

00:13:31.320 --> 00:13:35.800
And after a heated exchange
of words, let us begin the match.

00:13:35.800 --> 00:13:37.550
Final battle, ready?

00:13:38.190 --> 00:13:42.250
It's true, I have no idea what these guys are thinking.

00:13:42.250 --> 00:13:44.890
Anyway, I can only go all out!

00:13:46.740 --> 00:13:49.050
Three, Two, One!

00:13:49.440 --> 00:13:51.840
Go... Shoot!

00:13:55.330 --> 00:13:57.730
This is it, Dragoon! Go!

00:14:02.260 --> 00:14:03.280
What?!

00:14:03.280 --> 00:14:08.150
Oh? Dragoon was bounced back, but was somehow able to resist!

00:14:11.740 --> 00:14:14.920
That bulky balance, just like a giant tortoise....

00:14:15.140 --> 00:14:19.360
I see! Takao, his Bey is a natural born defender!

00:14:20.340 --> 00:14:23.920
Natural or whatever,
all I have to do is blow him away!

00:14:24.230 --> 00:14:24.840
Dragoon!

00:14:33.850 --> 00:14:36.970
Stop, Takao! You're playing into their hand!

00:14:37.990 --> 00:14:41.000
That jerk is just spinning around, and yet..!

00:14:44.780 --> 00:14:50.280
Oh?! Bartolomeo's sudden attack sends Dragoon flying!

00:14:51.080 --> 00:14:52.500
Dragoon!

00:14:54.160 --> 00:14:58.430
Giant tortoises aren't just bulky.

00:14:58.430 --> 00:14:59.220
What?!

00:15:02.240 --> 00:15:06.200
Wow, you're pretty strong. Who would have guessed?

00:15:06.560 --> 00:15:08.720
S-Stop with that kind of story!

00:15:12.480 --> 00:15:14.890
See? Isn't my Bey awesome?

00:15:14.890 --> 00:15:18.180
A giant tortoise's gift is really something.

00:15:18.180 --> 00:15:21.430
If you do something good, the gods will reward you.

00:15:22.730 --> 00:15:23.680
Why you..!

00:15:23.680 --> 00:15:25.370
Takao, calm down!
I can't keep quiet! What's this about being awarded by the gods?! A gift from a tortoise?! Don't mess around!

00:15:25.370 --> 00:15:26.910
<i>Cool down!</i>

00:15:26.910 --> 00:15:29.880
This is no good. He's let himself get mad.

00:15:29.880 --> 00:15:32.000
Hey, Takao!

00:15:32.000 --> 00:15:36.350
How could you let yourself be swayed by your opponent and lose yourself?!

00:15:36.350 --> 00:15:38.460
And you call yourself my descendant?!

00:15:38.460 --> 00:15:39.390
Grandpa...

00:15:39.390 --> 00:15:41.870
The way of the sword is a fight against oneself.

00:15:41.870 --> 00:15:47.930
When you abandon your fleeting emotions, you will see the light. I thought you learned this in your training!

00:15:47.930 --> 00:15:49.930
Or did you forget it already?!

00:15:49.930 --> 00:15:53.350
Oh shut up. I already know all that.

00:15:53.350 --> 00:15:54.230
Dang it!

00:15:55.920 --> 00:16:00.330
Gah! He's even ignoring me!

00:16:01.240 --> 00:16:09.470
I see. Sure they're weird, but when they're focused on their Bey, they're not so different from everyone else.

00:16:09.470 --> 00:16:13.960
No, they're even more focused. Alright, I should follow his example!

00:16:16.160 --> 00:16:20.160
Wow! The Bey that giant tortoise
gave me sure is great!

00:16:21.680 --> 00:16:22.950
Dragoon!

00:16:27.350 --> 00:16:30.360
Go, Dragoon Typhoon!

00:16:35.250 --> 00:16:38.940
W-Wow! It's just like a real typhoon!

00:16:51.910 --> 00:16:53.730
Where is Bartolomeo's Bey?

00:16:59.330 --> 00:17:00.290
<i>Great!</i>

00:17:01.640 --> 00:17:05.250
T-The winner is Takao Kinomiya!

00:17:05.250 --> 00:17:07.180
Alright!

00:17:07.180 --> 00:17:13.800
A great comeback victory! In this second day of the tournament, the team to advance to the semi-finals...

00:17:14.020 --> 00:17:16.300
is the BBA team!

00:17:18.440 --> 00:17:25.360
Not only did he get a hold of himself, he even came up with a new move. That Takao never stops surprising me.

00:17:26.090 --> 00:17:28.680
Takao! Nice fight!

00:17:28.680 --> 00:17:33.710
You did it! Now the new Dragoon is completely under your control!

00:17:38.840 --> 00:17:39.870
Sign this please!

00:17:39.870 --> 00:17:41.180
Shake hands with me!

00:17:41.180 --> 00:17:43.080
Take a picture with me!

00:17:44.390 --> 00:17:47.090
W-What's with these guys?!

00:17:47.880 --> 00:17:48.840
Here you go.

00:17:48.840 --> 00:17:50.950
You're really strong!

00:17:50.950 --> 00:17:52.180
You too.

00:17:52.180 --> 00:17:54.730
I have a nice story to tell back home.

00:17:54.730 --> 00:17:55.840
See you.

00:17:56.200 --> 00:17:57.330
Yeah...

00:17:58.480 --> 00:18:01.080
They're really a mysterious bunch.

00:18:01.080 --> 00:18:04.480
We were swept up in their pace till the very end.

00:18:04.710 --> 00:18:08.020
That was quite an interesting match.

00:18:08.350 --> 00:18:10.170
Old man Daitenji!

00:18:10.170 --> 00:18:13.600
Oh, I don't see Shiratori-kun around.

00:18:13.600 --> 00:18:16.040
Oh yeah, where did Kai go this time?

00:18:16.040 --> 00:18:21.790
Ah-ah. I bet he's gone to the other stadium to see the PPB's match.

00:18:21.790 --> 00:18:27.440
That's right. The match between the PPB team and the Australian team is about to begin.

00:18:27.440 --> 00:18:30.160
It's a must-see fight between powerful teams.

00:18:30.160 --> 00:18:32.010
They're about to fight, huh...

00:18:32.010 --> 00:18:34.980
No time to waster. Let's go see it!

00:18:34.980 --> 00:18:35.510
Yeah.

00:18:37.040 --> 00:18:41.810
Take a close look at how the PPB fights.

00:18:54.440 --> 00:18:56.980
The winner is Steve!

00:18:57.920 --> 00:19:01.130
The Bey just now flew all the way from there?!

00:19:01.130 --> 00:19:02.000
Unbelievable...

00:19:02.000 --> 00:19:03.290
Took you long enough.

00:19:03.290 --> 00:19:07.080
Th match is over already. America won twice in a row.

00:19:07.080 --> 00:19:08.140
Twice in a row?

00:19:08.140 --> 00:19:08.890
<i>What?!</i>

00:19:08.890 --> 00:19:10.720
<i>Ladies and gentlemen.</i>

00:19:11.040 --> 00:19:14.680
Sorry for the wait. The hero ia about to arrive!

00:19:18.280 --> 00:19:22.990
Welcome, American Hero, Micheal Waterson!

00:19:35.490 --> 00:19:36.940
M-Micheal..?

00:19:36.940 --> 00:19:38.940
What a flashy entrance...

00:19:38.940 --> 00:19:41.230
Seriously, he's always such a show-off.

00:19:41.230 --> 00:19:45.450
Micheal, stop with the fan
service and get on with the match.

00:19:45.450 --> 00:19:46.720
Okay.

00:19:46.720 --> 00:19:49.380
Get off your high horse, you show-off!

00:19:49.920 --> 00:19:54.080
I don't care if you're a star player or whatever, I'm going to make you regret this!

00:19:54.600 --> 00:19:57.720
<i>Alright.</i> Let's start the show.

00:19:57.720 --> 00:20:02.410
His dormant talent must be baseball.
But where is his Bey?

00:20:02.410 --> 00:20:04.620
Final battle, ready?

00:20:04.620 --> 00:20:08.830
They've come to spy on us?
Go ahead, look all you want.

00:20:08.830 --> 00:20:10.700
It's not going to last long, though.

00:20:10.700 --> 00:20:13.800
Three, Two, One!

00:20:13.800 --> 00:20:15.500
Go... Shoot!

00:20:16.910 --> 00:20:18.370
A ball-shaped shooter?!

00:20:18.370 --> 00:20:21.810
Take a close look! Come on!

00:20:25.040 --> 00:20:26.050
That's..!

00:20:26.050 --> 00:20:27.320
A Sacred Beast!

00:20:34.650 --> 00:20:37.180
The winner is Micheal!

00:20:38.270 --> 00:20:39.790
The Bey was shattered..!

00:20:39.790 --> 00:20:40.670
<i>No!</i>

00:20:43.410 --> 00:20:46.280
Check his heart rate and oxygen contained in his blood.

00:20:46.280 --> 00:20:47.880
Take Trigle to maintenance.

00:20:48.640 --> 00:20:51.930
You didn't have to go all out against a weak opponent like that!

00:20:51.930 --> 00:20:53.700
It was guest service.

00:20:55.520 --> 00:21:01.320
Max, now you understand. There is no way you can win against us.

00:21:02.510 --> 00:21:03.900
Mama...

00:21:03.900 --> 00:21:08.040
W-Wow! He destroyed that Bey in a single move.

00:21:08.040 --> 00:21:10.530
Looks like you've met your strongest opponent.

00:21:11.310 --> 00:21:12.920
Grandpa.

00:21:12.920 --> 00:21:19.120
Physical ability, scientific power, team work. They excel at everything.

00:21:19.120 --> 00:21:21.920
If you'll face off against them, it's going to be tough.

00:21:22.860 --> 00:21:25.010
Things are getting interesting.

00:21:39.960 --> 00:21:44.720
Spring waves its hand smiling,

00:21:44.720 --> 00:21:50.200
Summer spreads passion.

00:21:50.200 --> 00:21:55.350
Seasons pass one after the other,

00:21:55.350 --> 00:21:59.560
Fall and Winter are good friends.

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:05.660
When there is a problem you can't solve,

00:22:05.660 --> 00:22:11.560
Trust, friendship, love and emotion

00:22:14.120 --> 00:22:18.800
Clouds keep flying across the sky,

00:22:18.800 --> 00:22:24.200
the sky keeps changing every second

00:22:24.200 --> 00:22:29.090
My eyes well up and tears stream down my face,

00:22:29.090 --> 00:22:33.090
but they're not tears of sadness

00:22:34.820 --> 00:22:39.420
I summon my courage and try to put it into words.

00:22:39.420 --> 00:22:44.770
"Let's go on a journey to the city of hope!"

00:22:44.770 --> 00:22:49.760
All your dreams will come true

00:22:57.720 --> 00:23:02.100
According to my analysis, next up are the semi-finals of the American tournament.

00:23:02.100 --> 00:23:04.880
But we're up against the powerful Brazilian team.

00:23:04.880 --> 00:23:08.280
A samba dancer and an Amazonian warrior.

00:23:08.280 --> 00:23:10.520
It's a bunch of passionate fighters!

00:23:10.830 --> 00:23:14.470
On top of that, there's the Highway Stadium, that makes the circuit spin.

00:23:14.470 --> 00:23:17.400
Things are spinning and flying all around!

00:23:17.400 --> 00:23:20.920
Next time: Semi-Final - Super High Speed Circuit!

00:23:20.920 --> 00:23:24.200
Oh! It's spinning even faster than usual!
